{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.ShadowPriceContinuity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.ShadowPriceContinuity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ShadowPriceContinuity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ShadowPriceContinuity","kind":"theorem","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/shadow-price-continuity.lean#L18-L32","doc":"**Continuity of shadow prices on the generic locus.**\n\nModel the shadow price as `u_λ(q) = w_λ(q)/d_λ(q) − cℓ(q)` where\n`w_λ` is the partition weight, `d_λ` the q-dimension, and\n`cℓ(q) = 1/[k]_q!` the common normaliser — all continuous in `q`.\nOn the generic locus where `d_λ(q₀) ≠ 0`, the rational function\n`u_λ` is continuous at `q₀`: the quotient is continuous where its\ndenominator is nonzero, and subtracting the continuous `cℓ`\npreserves continuity. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:shadow-price-continuity","label":"prop:shadow-price-continuity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/shadow-price-continuity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}